  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Linking Preparedness, survivor-led emergency response, well-being and long-term resilience Isiolo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to aim to improve the socio-economic situation of households are facing extreme hardship due to the collapse of livelihoods attributed to among other disasters such as drought, conflict, and fires. The households can hardly meet basic needs, have lost resilience and therefore need external help to be able to recover. Its specific objectives are:
&#x2022;To improve socio-economic wellbeing of 300 poor and vulnerable households in Isiolo County through increased access to mini-grants.
&#x2022;To enable 300 poor and vulnerable households to comprehensively embrace approach during the crisis to lead and manage their own immediate emergency (well-being) responses in ways that can strengthen long-term resilience and contribute to transformational change in the community.</narrative>
  </description>
